## Definition of done
- `scripts/check` passes locally.
- New behaviour has tests; bug fixes start with a failing test that reproduces the bug.
- No changes to protected paths (see `.coding-plugin.json`) without explicit approval.
- This file and the docs are updated when commands or conventions change.

## Boundaries
- Work on a feature branch, never directly on main.
- Never commit secrets, and never read `.env` or other secrets files.
- Ask before adding dependencies, changing public APIs or making large refactors.
